indrng is a small independent random number generator designed to
allow generation of a random seed with real entropy without needing
to be dependent on a specific ISA or OS backend. This is imported
for the generic c backend's randomization primitive.

This project was pulled from 

	https://codeberg.org/vantheman/indrng

and is licensed under same license as this project (which is PD).

I would like to give thanks to the creator of this project, who
is me.

